Open Visual Studio Code and create a new Flutter project.
Open the lib folder and select main.dart.
Import the Flutter Material package.
Create the main() function and run the application using runApp().
Create a MaterialApp with a HomeScreen as the initial screen.
Design the Home Screen using Scaffold and AppBar.
Display a welcome message and a View Products button using Text and ElevatedButton.
Use Navigator.push() and MaterialPageRoute to navigate to the Product Details Screen when the button is clicked.
Create the Product Details Screen using another Scaffold and AppBar.
Display three products: Notebook – Rs.50, Pen – Rs.10 and Pencil – Rs.5.
Add a Back button and use Navigator.pop(context) to return to the Home Screen.
Run the application using flutter run and verify the navigation between both screens.
